<title>PORTUGAL: Sonae to keep '96 dividend unchanged at 150 esc.</title>
<headline>Sonae to keep '96 dividend unchanged at 150 esc.</headline>
<dateline>OPORTO, Portugal 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Portuguese retail group Sonae Investimentos said it would propose to the next shareholders' general assembly a gross 1996 dividend of 150 escudos per share, unchanged from 1995.</p>
</text>
